--- !u!114 &916880256
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 916880254}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 12edae90124e638439527b984cf5f583, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialoguePanel: {fileID: 916880254}
  nameText: {fileID: 1720841105}
  dialogueText: {fileID: 488267970}
  portraitImage: {fileID: 712020747}
  voiceSource: {fileID: 916880259}
  dialogueLines:
  - name: Kael
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0b94400a8fa9dbf478617c5a10841288, type: 3}
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b4ce72120ceec274dbc4914b66b2ae6f, type: 3}
    sentence: Finally awake, Mia? Stop daydreaming and listen up... The world is
      in total chaos right now. Countless <color=#DA70D6><b>'Knowledge Monsters'
      </b></color> are wandering everywhere.
  - name: Kael
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6ae9933d477c02d4b909aa99f24a4a13, type: 3}
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e1c0c9c6a4ffa0744a8af00421229c5e, type: 3}
    sentence: If you want to protect yourself and get stronger, go challenge those
      <color=#DA70D6><b>'Subject Monsters.'</b></color> Whether it's Chinese, English,
      or Math, defeating them is your only path to gaining knowledge and leveling
      up.
  - name: Kael
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 64ffd6c458465304e9b63c24ea9ec5d3, type: 3}
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: eccb7bb6703090245a4705aee14799db, type: 3}
    sentence: You will earn gold coins as a reward for victory. Remember, only through
      diligent fighting will you get the rewards you deserve. These resources are
      vital for your journey.
  - name: Kael
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0b94400a8fa9dbf478617c5a10841288, type: 3}
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8fbdef340a7cd6049aa5d5638893d972, type: 3}
    sentence: See that the red house? That's Bella here.Take your gold go house <color=#FFD700><b>Press
      E</b></color> to <color=#87CEEB><b>buy or craft equipment</b></color>. Don't
      go around with your defenses looking full of holes.
  - name: Mia
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b73906580a6190144b38bdb6ecf8e72f, type: 3}
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ba819da9c56eca64cbc9d4134ea6412f, type: 3}
    sentence: Bella...? Is Bella here?
  - name: Mia
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0e9db20f9ba43a248b15eb047539ad6e, type: 3}
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 48674d5fed0159041b5e295a98ca4c0b, type: 3}
    sentence: I see... I'll be careful and go look for Bella.
  - name: Keal
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 64ffd6c458465304e9b63c24ea9ec5d3, type: 3}
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5905bd34e79dcd341b1ac786fc6d2b49, type: 3}
    sentence: Stop wasting time and go.
